Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.70,0:06:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像付帐之类的  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...paying for stuff, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以来这里工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if you want, you can work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我演过连续剧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, I was a regular on a soap opera, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从明星到服务生  我实在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And to go from that to this, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  还得招呼我所有的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And plus, I'd have to wait on all my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白  但这里薪水很高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. But the money's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还可以看瑞秋看个够\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus, you get to stare at Rachel as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.19,0:06:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,工作时间很弹性\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Flexible hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许可以啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe I could be a waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.07,0:06:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以用电话吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Could I use the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:07:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她选瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She picked Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她想改口  但是很明显   她选瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, she tried to back out of it, but it was obvious. She picked Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.21,0:07:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他偷了我的笑话  就这么偷走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He took my joke. He just took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是错误的  还有什么是不对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is wrong. You know what else is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比选了瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe picking Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁会选瑞秋  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know who else picked Rachel? Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯还做了什么  他偷了我的笑话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what else Ross did? He stole my joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.35,0:07:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要买一本笑话日记本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna get a joke journal, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记录我每次讲笑话的日期时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And document the date and time of every single one of my jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好主意  知道什么主意不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good idea. Know what's a bad idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,选择瑞秋   没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Picking Rachel. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是罗斯爬进我的脑袋   窃取我的思维\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe it's the sound of Ross climbing into my brain and stealing my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是客厅传来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's coming from the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的书看完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I finished my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.85,0:08:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you guys look cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是可爱的情侣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys make a cute couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你在干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  我只是想重温前两天的乐趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing, Just trying to re-create some of the fun that we had at my place the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.74,0:08:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得吗  就是你选瑞秋  不选我那次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remember? When you picked Rachel over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多好玩啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was funny. Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是蛮好玩的   一点也不好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was kind of funny. It wasn't funny at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么选她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不选我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why didn't you pick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以稍微倾向瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The reason I was leaning a little bit more toward Rachel than you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is just, you know, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点难搞   我们去吃饭吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...high maintenance. Let's go to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.97,0:08:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪有这回事啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is completely untrue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我难搞   证明给我看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You think I'm high maintenance? Okay, Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你列一张清单  我们逐条讨论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want you write out a list, and we're going to go through it point by point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   你说的对  你很好相处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you're right, you're easygoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是没有瑞秋那么好相处  她比较\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're just not as easygoing as Rachel. you know, She's just more...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有弹性  比较圆融   就这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...flexible and mellow. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, people are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋什么都好  怎么欺负她都行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ya, you know, Rachel...she'll do whatever you want. Y'know, you can just walk all over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着  你是说我没个性吗  我有个性\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Wait a minute. What are you saying, that I'm a pushover? I'm not a pushover.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你有个性\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay. You're not a pushover.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪   你觉得我没个性\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You think I'm a pushover. Well, watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听着  我们不跟你去吃饭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you know what? You're not invited to lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样   够强硬了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you think of that? I think that's pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.81,0:09:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是这么想的  快点  摩妮卡  我们去吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that's what I think. Come on, Monica, let's go to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,清单给我列出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You start working on that list.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真是太扯了  就是啊  你想吃什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I cannot believe her. I know. Where do you want to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢那家日本料理   我吃腻日本菜了  不去那家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh-Oh, I love that Japanese place. I'm sick of Japanese. Not going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.87,0:09:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那看你  想去哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wherever you want to go is cool. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿甘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, Gunther...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个钱德真的很好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that-that Chandler cracks me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你要喝什么吗  我要去柜台\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey Ross, listen, you want anything to drink,‘cause I’m heading up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要  我要咖啡   谢谢  不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I'll take a coffee. Thanks. man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咖啡  不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Coffee? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要咖啡吗  我要去柜台\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Coffee? ‘Cause I’m going up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了  不了  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要什么吗   我要去柜台\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys need anything, ‘cause I’m heading up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要一杯冰水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd love ice water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   你在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.95,0:10:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,表示友善啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just being friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   你不能去柜台后面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, honey, I don’t think you’re supposed to go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系啦  对吧  阿甘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's okay. Right, Gunther?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我使眼色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't wink at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把围裙穿上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And put on your apron.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.26,0:10:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿就穿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Heh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.76,0:10:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么不叫其他客人穿围裙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I don’t see you asking other paying customers to put on aprons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.73,0:10:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你在这里打工吗  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, do you work here? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,服务生  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Waiter. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  怎么回事  为什么不告诉我们你在这里打工\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, what's going on'? Why didn't you tell us you work here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.87,0:11:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这件事其实挺尴尬的  我之前是演员  现在是服务生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's kind of embarrassing. I mean, I was an actor, now I'm a waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一般应该反过来才对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's supposed to go in the other direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的围裙反穿了  成披风了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So's your apron. You're wearing it like a cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.71,0:11:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这份工作很简单   薪水很高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, the job's easy and the money's good, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我也在这儿混   干脆赚个钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess I'm going to be hanging out here anyway. I might as well get paid for it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是要招呼你们   感觉上很怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just feel kind of weird serving you guys, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.64,0:11:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It'll be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我也做过  还好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, I did it and it was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  怎么会怪呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would it be weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   帮我端个咖啡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey? Can I get some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.53,0:11:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确实没那么怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. It doesn't seem that weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说真的   我点的咖啡还没来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seriously, I asked before. You still haven't gotten it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看嘛  现在又变怪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, now it's weird again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里工作是好事   你会赚大钱   先给你一个忠告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think it's great that you work here. You're gonna make a lot of money. Here's your first tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黄色的雪不要吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't eat yellow snow. Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2点15分  咖啡馆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}2:15, coffeehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  总算有人能传承我的智慧了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you know This is great. Finally, I have someone I can pass my wisdom to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你几件我在这里学到的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me tell you about a couple of things I learned while working at the coffeehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先  顾客永远是对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}First of all, the customer is always right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,微笑能让你无往不胜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A smile goes a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人对你不客气   你就朝松饼打喷嚏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if anyone is ever rude to you, sneeze muffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks, Rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们对我真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, look, you guys are just terrific, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.99,0:12:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要清场  让别人进来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about clearing out so I can get some new customers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有流动才有商机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's all about turnover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想喝咖啡了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seriously, can I get my coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉   罗斯   马上来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm sorry, Ross.I'll get it for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你久等了   送块松饼作为补偿吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And since I made you wait, I'll toss in a free muffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.89,0:12:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我们想跟你谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, we'd like to talk to you for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
