Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉这么说   但是你   菲比  是个怪人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, we are very sorry to tell you this, but you, Phoebe, are flaky.
