Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  你怪也无所谓了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what, you're just okay with being flaky?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全无所谓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我难搞也无所谓了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then I'm okay with being high maintenance.
