Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  无所谓就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great. Good for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不难搞   我才不会没个性\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am not high maintenance! I am not a pushover!
