Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.87,0:13:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗   我喜欢你的自然色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? I like your natural color.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:14:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托啦  这是个好角色  我演男主角的死党\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on man, It's a great part. Check it out. I'm the lead guy's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在酒吧帮他占位子  你听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wait for him in this bar and save his seat. Listen.
