Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这些  对啊  或许不是他的死党  但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the whole part? Okay, maybe he's not his best friend, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  1小时后见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'll see you in an hour.
