Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.83,0:14:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用你干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说嘛  各位请注意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Exactly! All right, everybody listen up!
