Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了孩子们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's for the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助孩子们远离毒品\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, to keep the kids off drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是本期《花花公子》的重要报导\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. It's a very important issue in this month's Playboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位一定都看过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sure you all read about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的笑话  是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's my joke. It's my joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's my joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.29,0:15:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们再吵也吵不出结果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, I don't think  we're gonna settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让摩妮卡决定吧  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Let's have Monica decide. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小妹  亲爱的  出来一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Mon! Mon, get out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来帮我们决定   这个笑话是谁的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have to help us decide whose joke this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要我决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do I have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你才能客观公正\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're the only one that can be fair. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.43,0:15:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能   你是我男朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't be. You're my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.51,0:15:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我是你哥  我们是一家人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I'm your brother. We're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世上最重要的就是亲情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the most important thing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要想左右她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't try to sway her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.81,0:15:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有我能让你生小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm your only chance to have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始吧  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, let's go. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会说出这个笑话的由来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll each tell you how we came up with the joke...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:16:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你再决定谁说的是实话  是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and then you decide which one of us is telling the truth—me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   你先说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, you go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我是2个月前  跟史提夫吃饭时想到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I thought of the joke two months ago at lunch with Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是圣诞节遇到的那家伙吗   让我说完好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait, is he the guy I meet him at Christmas? Can I finish my story?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我选你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you want me to pick you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看嘛  我绝对不会那样凶你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, I would never snap at you like that.
