Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请继续  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Continue. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史提夫说他要去看医生   他的医生姓侯奇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Steve said he had to go to the doctor. And his doctor's name is Dr. Mompey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就说  "猴子医生"   所以才会有猴子医生这个笑话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I said, "Dr. Monkey?" And that is how the whole Dr. Monkey thing came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你开什么玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是学进化论的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look, I study evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得吧  进化论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remember? Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猴子进化成人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monkey into man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.25,0:16:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,况且  我还是博士  而且\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus, I'm a doctor. And...
