Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.34,0:16:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是猴子博士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Dr. Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.01,0:17:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这点我不跟你争  好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not arguing with that. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.68,0:17:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以了  我决定好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've heard enough. I've made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.98,0:17:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  好吧   请说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! Okay, so what--? Do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个都是白痴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are both idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.65,0:17:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个笑话不但不好笑   还冒犯了女性\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The joke is not funny, and it's offensive to women.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有医生   还有猴子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And doctors. And monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.03,0:17:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不该争笑话是谁的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You shouldn't argue over who gets credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该争的是  谁让这世界受这种罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should be arguing over who gets blamed for inflicting this horrible joke upon the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再争了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个笑话烂透了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The joke sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的笑话   不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's your joke. It is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  天呐  你在这里  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, Chandler, there you are. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  是菲比和瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, it's Phoebe and Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要告诉她们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you tell them...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说我并不难搞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...what you were telling me earlier about me not being high maintenance.
