Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟她在一起就像是在度假\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Being with her has been like being on a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至于所谓的难搞嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what may be perceived as high maintenance...
