Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心灵的慷慨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...generosity of spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  这真是我所听过的  最棒的假话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. You know what? That is the best fake speech I think I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  我还听过更棒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? I've heard better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.03,0:18:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   那是他自己说的  你告诉她们  钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, he came up with that himself. Tell them, Chandler.
