Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你上我的黑名单了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are on my list!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  你并不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I'm sorry, but you're not--
