Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样就很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你为小事不高兴时   我觉得我特别能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And when you get upset about little things, I think I'm pretty good...
