Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样也很好  所以她们说你难搞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's good too. They say you're high maintenance...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也没错   因为我喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but it's okay, because I like...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞定你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...maintaining you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没叫他说这些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't even tell him to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.58,0:19:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从黑名单除名了  我被除名了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, you're off my list. I'm off the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不找我当女朋友也没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay that you don't want me to be your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我有最棒的男朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I have the best boyfriend.
