Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  试镜结果如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, buddy boy, How'd the audition go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不太好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, not good. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没拿到那个角色  这里的工作也没了  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't get the part. And I lost my job here, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:19:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好惨烈的试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, that is a bad audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.11,0:20:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的工作为什么没了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, how did you lose your job here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I had the audition...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但阿甘叫我看店  他好去染头发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but Gunther said I had to stay here and be in charge so he could get his hair dyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是去了  他就炒我鱿鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I went anyway, and he fired me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他扔下工作去办私事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He left work in the middle of the day to do a personal errand...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫才来两天的你看店\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and left you in charge when you've been here two days?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样不对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是能怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你不能就这么算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, you can't let him get away with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不放过他   我要去教训他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ya know what, I won't let him get away with that. I'm gonna say something to him--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不该多事  不  我要去教训他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I really shouldn't say anything. No, I should say something to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿甘  让乔伊继续在这里打工\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gunther? I want you to give Joey his job back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.53,0:20:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样解雇他  很不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is really not fair that you have to fire him-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  他可以继续工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? He can have his job back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他可以继续工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right, he can have his job back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说开了就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Glad we got that all straightened out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.13,0:21:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There you go, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以继续工作了  太好了  谢谢你  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Got your job back. That's great. Thanks, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不赖吧  谁没个性了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pretty nice, huh? Now who's a pushover?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.93,0:21:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你坐到我的位子了  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, you're in my seat. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都没说会找谁当女朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I never got to hear who you'd pick to be your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我选你  菲比  没错   绝对是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd pick you, Phoebe. Yeah, definitely you, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也这么觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I kind of thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  绝对是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Never. It would totally be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.25,0:21:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个问题   如果你们要找其中一个人当男朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Oh, I have a question. If-if-if one of you had to pick one of the other two to go out with...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.43,0:21:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会找谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who would you pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来  我拒绝回答\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way. I'm not answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来  我拒绝回答\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way, I'm not answering that.
